# Magic Scarf — QA Validation Checklist

Walk this before handoff. Mark each item ✅ or ❌. Block ship on any ❌.

## A · Universal hard rules

- [ ] Page opens by double-clicking `index.html` (no server required)
- [ ] No console errors when home page loads
- [ ] No 404 image references in DevTools Network tab
- [ ] No nested `<a>` anywhere (auto-checked: 0 instances)
- [ ] No "lorem ipsum" / "TODO" / `[placeholder]` / `via.placeholder.com` (auto-checked: 0 instances)
- [ ] No fabricated dollar prices on any product card or PDP
- [ ] No pure white `#FFFFFF` outside cards/swatch (audit: 2 acceptable instances — card surface + white swatch)
- [ ] No pure black `#000000` (audit: 0 instances)
- [ ] Single self-contained HTML file under 1.5 MB

## B · Responsive

- [ ] **375 px (iPhone SE)** — no horizontal scroll, 2-col card grid, hamburger menu reaches all 9 nav items
- [ ] **768 px (iPad portrait)** — 3-col card grid, header collapses appropriately
- [ ] **1024 px** — 3-col grid, primary nav visible
- [ ] **1280 px** — full layout with 4-col card grid
- [ ] **1500 px+** — content stays capped at `--w-page: 1280px`, no awkward stretching
- [ ] All sections reflow gracefully — no overflowing cards, no clipped text

